  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp; is an arbitrary constant.&nbsp;Then, the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
